(text "5V_LOGIC  U1 LM2596  ESP32, RX, halls, U2   ~0.5 A  F4 2 A\n3V3_SENSE U2 AMS1117 IBT-2 logic, I2C       ~0.1 A  (via F4)\n5V_ACC    U3 5 A     DFPlayer, USB, LEDs    ≤5 A    F5 3 A\n12V_ACC   U4 10-20 A lights F9, amp F10     ≤10 A   F6 10 A\nFuses are on the 24 V input side: 5 A at 5 V\nis about 1.2 A at 24 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 138.8 37.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0bb2f590-9344-5749-949a-ecffe36046a2"))
(text "Logic and accessories never share a converter. 3V3_SENSE comes from 5V_LOGIC, not the ESP32's own 3.3 V pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7bfb7f96-4a09-54cc-b947-f3d0a15bfda9"))
(text "Set each buck's output with a meter before connecting any load." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 17.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0a5af289-0b32-509b-8aed-5eb42386a178"))
